# No environment variables are required to develop, build, or test this
# repo by default:
#   - apps/marketing falls back to in-memory SQLite when DATABASE_URL is unset.
#   - packages/core and packages/ui tests need nothing.
#
# Optional — marketing homepage users demo (Postgres / Neon):
#   Copy into apps/marketing/.env (not the repo root) for local Next.js:
#     DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host/db?sslmode=require
#   When set, the homepage uses Neon via Drizzle; ticket /examples stay on SQLite.
#
# The only *test* env vars in this monorepo are MySQL/Postgres connection
# strings for the Drizzle adapter's integration suites (not run by default).
# See packages/adapters/drizzle/.env.example.
